    <!-- =============== Safety zone marking (SF 07 pattern) ============ -->
    <!-- The arena's pattern, so M5's safety and autonomy demonstrations can
         be recorded in ONE world. See the file header: this is paint, not a
         sensor, and nothing in this file watches it. -->
    <!-- On open apron floor where the central cross aisle meets the dock
         aisle, which is the crossing a monitored zone would watch. -->
